# data/cache/*.json (link-watch manifests, monitor/health state) and
# logs/*.log are tracked ON PURPOSE: this is how the office laptop gets the
# exact same link-watch baseline on `git pull` instead of re-baselining from
# scratch and missing whatever was published in the gap.

